  displayName: Nozomi
  description: 'I''m a little bit worried about her. She seems tired, like dead-face
    tired. Maybe is the fact that she is an Animator. She likes to make doodles,
    cartoons and more in her free time. And also it''s her full time work, obviously
    she is tired! ... But she is fine for now.. even if the requirement she asks
    are a little bit much.. I can maybe have more time with her, if she asks, THAT
    I KNOW SHE WILL. She needs someone and I''m here to fill that role! '
